    "body": "![marmot](https://blossom.primal.net/8eb4ccbe65eaa7fb9061d9f2160e91fbc3c389bb5f396cb0ea0f685a59100ac2.png)\n\nEvery marmot deserves a proper gallery — so each README section now has its own SNES-style pixel art illustration to welcome readers into the burrow. Six sections, six paintings, one very proud colony artist.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Enhanced README with visual badges and illustrations across key sections including What is MDK?, How It Actually Works, Core Concepts, The API You'll Actually Use, Data Models, and What's Next to improve presentation and readability.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
